        </article>

        <article class="catalog-card">
          <div class="catalog-card-meta">
            <span class="catalog-card-prefix">/data:*</span>
            <span class="catalog-card-tag">10 workflows</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Data</h3>
          <p>Write SQL, visualize, validate analyses, ship dashboards. Snowflake, Databricks, BigQuery.</p>
          <span class="catalog-card-author">Anthropic</span>
        </article>

        <article class="catalog-card">
          <div class="catalog-card-meta">
