      <div class="catalog-footnote">
        <a href="/plugins" class="text-link">Browse the full plugin catalog &rarr;</a>
        <p class="catalog-credit">Plugins are authored by their listed owners; Pace curates and bundles them. <a href="https://github.com/GoldenBerry-SO/pace.tools/blob/main/NOTICE.md">Full attribution &rarr;</a></p>
